SETUP / BASELINE
Initial restricted-process loopback connection attempt timed out before any
successful handshake; the peer was relaunched on host loopback with reviewed
permissions. The archived protocol starts with that successful peer instance.
During UI setup, revision1 added4/5/6 before Start Live completed, so the actual
baseline contained six objects rather than the service's initial three.
UI showed Waiting to shoot / saved0; baseline checkpoint has zero GetObject.
This confirms all six existing objects were excluded from automatic download.

